s can include account names and credential identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Warning","style":"warning","type":"aside"},{"text":"Custom backends","level":3,"anchor":"Custom-backends","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Labels identify categories, such as "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.OATH","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"code":"com.yubico.YubiKit.FIDO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Metadata carries details such as byte counts and error codes; the default backend displays"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these as "},{"code":"key=value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" pairs. Message wording and metadata keys are not a stable API."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your backend controls formatting, storage, and export. YubiKit does not retain log messages."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yubikit\/loggingguide"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"documentation-header.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["2x","light"],"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header@2x.png"},{"traits":["2x","dark"],"url":"\/images\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation-header~dark@2x.png"}],"alt":"YubiKeys in a row","type":"image","identifier":"documentation-header.png"},"https://github.com/apple/swift-log":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log","title":"SwiftLog","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"SwiftLog"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/apple\/swift-log"},"doc://yubikit-swift.YubiKit/documentation/YubiKit/GettingStarted":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Prepare your project to connect to the YubiKey via NFC, SmartCard, Lightning and USB HID."}],"t